WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:21.116 --> 00:00:26.116
Subtitles by explosiveskull


00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:31.756
Many years ago my son...


00:00:31.996 --> 00:00:33.036
Our leader, Belo,


00:00:33.596 --> 00:00:35.836
battled against the destroyer...


00:00:36.116 --> 00:00:37.116
Cherno.


00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:39.436
Victory was within our grasp,


00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:40.836
when the evil Cherno


00:00:40.956 --> 00:00:42.236
forged a terrifying weapon...


00:00:42.956 --> 00:00:44.316
the Wave Eater!


00:00:45.276 --> 00:00:46.276
The weapon so powerful,


00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:51.036
it destroyed everything
it came in contact with.


00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:54.076
Hope faded.


00:00:54.396 --> 00:00:57.436
Until the Great Belo
gathered unique fighters


00:00:57.596 --> 00:01:01.036
with the ability to teleport


00:01:01.276 --> 00:01:03.196
and attacked Cherno!


00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:05.716
Boom! Boom!


00:01:06.556 --> 00:01:08.316
Cherno's ship crashed
into Earth's Moon


00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.596
splitting it into pieces.


00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:14.196
While Cherno escaped in a pod...
that pierced the Earth's core,


00:01:14.316 --> 00:01:15.956
and was trapped deep under the ground.


00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:18.476
Which is where we've chained him.


00:01:20.396 --> 00:01:21.876
The Earth suffered.


00:01:22.036 --> 00:01:24.356
The ice caps turned to deserts,
and the deserts froze over.


00:01:24.396 --> 00:01:26.596
New diseases and hardships emerged.


00:01:27.036 --> 00:01:31.156
So the Galactic Council
turned to the civilized universe


00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:33.196
asking them to help the humans.


00:01:34.036 --> 00:01:35.036
Imagine, my son,


00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:36.636
that just before the disaster,


00:01:36.836 --> 00:01:42.837
Earthlings had grown so close
to a new stage in their evolution...


00:01:43.157 --> 00:01:45.237
and three formidable Athletes


00:01:45.397 --> 00:01:48.196
born with the ability to teleport,


00:01:48.436 --> 00:01:50.836
emerged on the little blue planet.


00:01:51.316 --> 00:01:52.516
Remember this, my son,


00:01:53.436 --> 00:01:54.756
your father guards


00:01:54.876 --> 00:01:57.356
the most dangerous prisoner
in the universe!


00:01:57.596 --> 00:02:00.156
I know your mother is worried...


00:02:00.516 --> 00:02:03.316
...but Cherno's power weakens...


00:02:03.596 --> 00:02:05.996
and soon your father
will return home to you.


00:02:06.556 --> 00:02:08.196
This time for good...


00:02:08.356 --> 00:02:10.916
Message delivered to your son.


00:02:43.956 --> 00:02:47.236
Stop! Bucket filled. Next! Pump.


00:02:49.316 --> 00:02:50.516
Pump!


00:02:55.156 --> 00:02:56.156
Stop!


00:02:56.236 --> 00:02:57.236
Bucket filled!


00:02:58.556 --> 00:02:59.556
Next!


00:03:00.636 --> 00:03:01.636
Pump!


00:03:23.077 --> 00:03:24.077
One...


00:03:24.477 --> 00:03:25.477
Step forward.


00:03:27.197 --> 00:03:28.197
Two...


00:03:31.237 --> 00:03:32.237
Three...


00:03:34.077 --> 00:03:35.157
Watch out!


00:03:39.996 --> 00:03:41.916
Why does this stuff always
happen to me?


00:03:42.916 --> 00:03:43.916
Ah!


00:03:45.356 --> 00:03:46.996
I told you not to stand next to him!


00:03:47.156 --> 00:03:49.196
Weird stuff always happens to him!


00:03:49.316 --> 00:03:52.116
No... it's just that lizard
over there...


00:03:53.396 --> 00:03:54.636
And I'm afraid of... lizards...


00:03:55.996 --> 00:03:57.196
Thank you...


00:03:59.956 --> 00:04:01.076
Want your water or not?


00:04:01.636 --> 00:04:04.796
He's bad luck. Just take it and go.
Get out of here.


00:04:07.796 --> 00:04:10.277
Thank you. Thank you...


00:04:10.717 --> 00:04:12.837
I'm just trying to find a job today...
thanks.


00:05:01.597 --> 00:05:03.157
There are only two left...


00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:09.077
No more will be born
while I'm trapped in this pit.


00:05:09.997 --> 00:05:12.237
And when they take these from me


00:05:13.877 --> 00:05:16.877
this prison will turn into my grave.


00:05:17.877 --> 00:05:18.877
Father.


00:05:19.677 --> 00:05:21.437
The protogene didn't activate.


00:05:22.637 --> 00:05:24.357
Every time he's nearly killed,


00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:27.157
his blood boils with adrenaline


00:05:28.037 --> 00:05:30.077
but... it's... not enough.


00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:34.316
I invented this protogene...


00:05:36.516 --> 00:05:42.196
A combination of unique cells
inside a microscopic particle.


00:05:42.796 --> 00:05:48.476
In my hands, it can bring
a new war to the entire Universe.


00:05:48.876 --> 00:05:51.997
And yet it remains trapped


00:05:52.117 --> 00:05:55.717
inside the body
of a pathetic Earthling!


00:05:56.797 --> 00:05:58.397
Stop scaring him!


00:05:59.957 --> 00:06:01.797
Go and kill him!


00:06:02.917 --> 00:06:04.677
Before his death


00:06:05.317 --> 00:06:07.157
the protogene will ignite.


00:06:12.557 --> 00:06:13.637
Get out.


00:06:31.156 --> 00:06:32.996
Don't fail me.


00:06:33.636 --> 00:06:35.436
My perfect creation.


00:06:57.277 --> 00:06:58.517
3:3!


00:07:00.317 --> 00:07:01.797
And as always we are outnumbered!


00:07:01.877 --> 00:07:05.477
But one day a 4th Athlete
will finally arise among us.


00:07:05.917 --> 00:07:07.557
The rules as you all know are simple:


00:07:07.597 --> 00:07:10.237
Each team must kick the ball
five times


00:07:10.397 --> 00:07:12.025
...in order to open
the opposing team's goal...


00:07:12.037 --> 00:07:14.037
and earn the chance to score.


00:07:14.277 --> 00:07:15.317
Salvo!


00:07:19.597 --> 00:07:22.557
Fan's kick knocks
the Sirusians in every direction


00:07:22.717 --> 00:07:25.556
as fast as the tickets sold
for this game!


00:07:25.836 --> 00:07:28.156
A terrific strike!
The Earthlings have the ball!


00:07:28.276 --> 00:07:32.077
Two more hits -
and the Sirusians' goal will come open!


00:07:32.597 --> 00:07:34.597
And all the way from cold,
snowed-caped Florida


00:07:34.717 --> 00:07:36.717
the Earthling's Pele is now
leading with the ball!


00:07:36.797 --> 00:07:39.237
Go on Pele! Give them your all!


00:07:41.917 --> 00:07:42.917
Salvo!


00:07:47.597 --> 00:07:49.477
Pele masterfully executes the 4th strike!


00:07:49.597 --> 00:07:52.557
One more and the Sirusians' goal
will be opened!


00:07:52.637 --> 00:07:53.517
Salvo!


00:07:53.637 --> 00:07:55.117
Pele intercepts the ball!


00:07:55.277 --> 00:07:56.717
And Fan moves in for the rebound,


00:07:56.837 --> 00:07:59.117
She spins like a tornado...
and strike!


00:08:04.797 --> 00:08:07.797
And give me a dog and call it Pluto!


00:08:07.997 --> 00:08:10.957
And the goal is open!


00:08:15.037 --> 00:08:17.397
The Sirusians' balls
will be ripped at the seams!


00:08:17.477 --> 00:08:19.557
While we cheer our awesome home team!


00:08:19.717 --> 00:08:24.197
Go little Fan! Pele is the one!
Natasha is our gun!


00:08:24.397 --> 00:08:27.157
I need a job, any job - come on!


00:08:27.317 --> 00:08:28.317
Quiet!


00:08:28.357 --> 00:08:29.996
I've been coming here for months!


00:08:30.197 --> 00:08:31.997
I'm watching the game!


00:08:32.117 --> 00:08:33.836
You're not listening to me...
I need...


00:08:36.197 --> 00:08:37.797
Everybody's watching.


00:08:38.237 --> 00:08:39.717
And you're distracting!


00:08:42.397 --> 00:08:43.397
I am not "everybody"!


00:08:51.437 --> 00:08:53.237
You should work,
and stop starring at the sky.


00:08:56.437 --> 00:08:58.237
Hey! What are you doing?
Hey!


00:08:59.957 --> 00:09:01.717
It's twenty years
since the moon was hit.


00:09:01.997 --> 00:09:03.997
Electricity for only an hour a day,
barely any food


00:09:04.037 --> 00:09:05.477
and all you care about is Cosmoball.


00:09:07.997 --> 00:09:09.157
A strike from Siriusian Stan.


00:09:09.637 --> 00:09:12.398
As Athletes fly like bowling pins!


00:09:12.638 --> 00:09:13.638
Big foot...


00:09:14.358 --> 00:09:17.518
It almost looks like Cosmoball
is turning into Cosmobowling!


00:09:17.638 --> 00:09:19.037
Wait! Here comes Natasha!


00:09:19.877 --> 00:09:20.997
Oh! What is he doing?


00:09:21.757 --> 00:09:24.077
It's a hit that sends
Natasha's Sputnik flying off her!


00:09:25.037 --> 00:09:26.957
She'll wanna reconnect to her Sputnik


00:09:27.237 --> 00:09:28.745
her bodyarmour,
her best pal as soon as possible


00:09:28.757 --> 00:09:30.757
if she's going to get back
into the game


00:09:30.957 --> 00:09:33.317
and help the humans play!


00:09:41.637 --> 00:09:42.637
Helmet.


00:09:44.397 --> 00:09:46.357
Pele, give me your hand!
Hand!


00:09:47.517 --> 00:09:50.357
And Pele launches her into the air!


00:09:51.117 --> 00:09:52.637
As Stan heads to the goal!


00:09:52.717 --> 00:09:54.797
Oh my, will nothing stop
him from hitting that ball!


00:09:58.877 --> 00:10:00.877
Goal!


00:10:01.597 --> 00:10:02.598
Holy zero gravity!


00:10:02.678 --> 00:10:04.238
I can barely keep my feet
on the ground!


00:10:04.398 --> 00:10:06.878
The Sirusians take the lead!


00:10:12.158 --> 00:10:16.037
- Goal!
- Yeah!


00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:20.197
What are you supporting?
They got the score!


00:10:20.357 --> 00:10:21.877
Stan is just amazing!


00:10:37.557 --> 00:10:38.557
Helmet!


00:10:39.077 --> 00:10:40.077
Helmet!


00:10:41.117 --> 00:10:42.797
You deaf?
Listen through your helmet.


00:10:42.877 --> 00:10:43.757
We're a team.


00:10:43.877 --> 00:10:45.157
What's your problem, huh?


00:10:45.637 --> 00:10:48.797
Power fluctuation is registered.
New Wave Eater incoming, sir.


00:10:52.918 --> 00:10:54.398
Very high strength reading.


00:10:54.878 --> 00:10:55.878
Prepare the arm!


00:11:00.558 --> 00:11:01.918
Then let's grab it while it's hot.


00:11:02.198 --> 00:11:03.198
Roger.


00:11:28.717 --> 00:11:31.517
Ahh, my creation!


00:11:46.998 --> 00:11:48.318
Switching to module 2.


00:11:48.918 --> 00:11:51.918
Steady now on the transfer.
You know it's always risky.


00:12:03.278 --> 00:12:05.358
Looks like Cherno
is giving us a fight today.


00:12:05.718 --> 00:12:06.718
Activate reserve.


00:12:06.838 --> 00:12:07.838
Initiate.


00:12:27.117 --> 00:12:29.157
Connect me to Belo!
Now!


00:12:40.278 --> 00:12:41.598
Belo on the playing field!


00:12:41.678 --> 00:12:43.078
And the game is stopped!


00:12:43.158 --> 00:12:46.158
And here comes the head
of the Galactic Cosmoball league.


00:12:46.238 --> 00:12:48.478
Belo! Belo!


00:12:50.718 --> 00:12:52.398
Oh he's so dreamy!


00:12:52.878 --> 00:12:54.878
- But he's an alien!
- Exactly!


00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:56.718
Looks like something's wrong.


00:12:56.958 --> 00:13:00.358
Oh I wish I could just teleport over there
and listen to what they're saying.


00:13:00.518 --> 00:13:03.118
Well, if I could teleport then I guess
I'd be the 4th Athlete


00:13:03.238 --> 00:13:06.077
and standing there anyway!


00:13:06.197 --> 00:13:07.197
Stan.


00:13:08.517 --> 00:13:10.157
Arterial overheating. Nap time.


00:13:14.877 --> 00:13:16.397
No! It Looks like Stan is overheating.


00:13:16.957 --> 00:13:19.157
Sirusians are so big,
their mass makes playing on.


00:13:19.237 --> 00:13:20.945
Earth's climate and magnetic field
twice as hard!


00:13:20.957 --> 00:13:21.957
I'm buying time.


00:13:23.357 --> 00:13:24.918
There's been a... technical difficulty.


00:13:52.718 --> 00:13:53.718
Flight up high!


00:14:04.077 --> 00:14:07.837
Transportation sequence engaged!
Reserve energies activated!


00:14:14.838 --> 00:14:17.518
No! Noooo!


00:14:33.198 --> 00:14:34.598
It's in the tunnel.


00:14:36.678 --> 00:14:37.718
Back to position!


00:14:40.278 --> 00:14:41.518
Good job today!


00:14:46.758 --> 00:14:47.558
Combat mode.


00:14:47.678 --> 00:14:48.678
Combat mode.


00:14:49.638 --> 00:14:50.638
Combat mode.


00:15:22.318 --> 00:15:24.998
HERE WE GOOOO!


00:15:29.758 --> 00:15:30.478
Salvo!


00:15:30.518 --> 00:15:31.518
One!


00:15:31.638 --> 00:15:32.638
Salvo!


00:15:33.158 --> 00:15:34.158
Two!


00:15:39.798 --> 00:15:40.798
Salvo!


00:15:42.878 --> 00:15:43.878
Three!


00:15:44.798 --> 00:15:45.798
Salvo!


00:15:45.918 --> 00:15:46.918
Four!


00:15:49.238 --> 00:15:52.478
And here comes the retaliation!


00:15:57.238 --> 00:15:57.878
It's hard to see what's going on


00:15:58.038 --> 00:15:59.238
Stan moves in for the block...


00:15:59.718 --> 00:16:00.958
but seems to be unsuccessful...


00:16:00.998 --> 00:16:03.718
- and lets Natasha make a free hit!
- Salvo!


00:16:03.878 --> 00:16:05.638
Team Earth has just made
five kicks in a row!


00:16:05.758 --> 00:16:07.238
The goal is open!


00:16:07.358 --> 00:16:08.918
Hit it, come on!


00:16:09.038 --> 00:16:10.038
Goal!


00:16:14.958 --> 00:16:16.518
Victory!


00:16:16.718 --> 00:16:17.598
For the first time in history,


00:16:17.678 --> 00:16:21.438
Earth is going to the finals!


00:16:29.878 --> 00:16:30.678
No!


00:16:30.878 --> 00:16:33.158
Noooo!


00:16:34.318 --> 00:16:35.878
Yes! Yes!


00:16:35.957 --> 00:16:37.318
I can't believe it!


00:16:38.597 --> 00:16:39.838
Outnumbered!


00:16:41.438 --> 00:16:42.478
With just three athletes!


00:16:43.318 --> 00:16:44.798
They still did it!


00:16:45.598 --> 00:16:46.599
Little Fan!


00:16:47.919 --> 00:16:48.719
Our Pele!


00:16:48.879 --> 00:16:52.277
And the captain of Team Earth - Natasha!


00:16:54.317 --> 00:16:55.598
Natasha!


00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:02.198
Yeah! We did it!


00:17:05.318 --> 00:17:06.318
Stan!


00:17:13.198 --> 00:17:17.438
What an incredible game, my friends!


00:17:18.478 --> 00:17:20.358
And as the public leaves the stadium...


00:17:21.078 --> 00:17:25.038
to back again tomorrow.


00:17:26.198 --> 00:17:28.518
I've been watching the games
for twenty years


00:17:28.638 --> 00:17:32.198
and every time my mouth
still hangs open like a child!


00:17:33.038 --> 00:17:35.038
Even though we played to a draw


00:17:35.158 --> 00:17:37.439
that draw ensures our team
reaches the finals,


00:17:37.599 --> 00:17:41.559
where we'll play against
the powerful Amazonians!


00:17:45.319 --> 00:17:48.118
So listen well my fellow Earthling...


00:17:48.718 --> 00:17:50.278
Because perhaps one of you out there...


00:17:50.398 --> 00:17:52.118
who will become the fourth Athlete...


00:17:52.358 --> 00:17:53.758
our team so desperately needs.


00:17:54.198 --> 00:17:55.878
As always, believe in yourself!


00:17:56.638 --> 00:17:58.078
Goodnight, until next time.


00:18:19.158 --> 00:18:21.198
Oh man! I was sitting this close!


00:18:21.278 --> 00:18:22.346
You should have seen that face!


00:18:22.358 --> 00:18:24.318
Next time, you go!


00:18:49.878 --> 00:18:52.878
Even if there were a planet
filled with losers.


00:18:53.358 --> 00:18:55.558
I'd still be the biggest loser there...


00:19:08.438 --> 00:19:09.438
Mom!


00:19:21.359 --> 00:19:22.359
Mom!


00:19:25.439 --> 00:19:26.559
Get up, I'll help you.


00:19:26.799 --> 00:19:27.799
Did we win?


00:19:30.159 --> 00:19:34.479
Am I the only person who isn't
brainwashed by that stupid game?


00:19:34.759 --> 00:19:35.759
Sit.


00:19:36.559 --> 00:19:37.559
Thank you.


00:19:38.679 --> 00:19:39.999
Where's your medicine?


00:19:42.678 --> 00:19:44.958
Mom! You told me
you still had some left!


00:19:46.078 --> 00:19:47.678
I'm feeling much better.


00:19:50.638 --> 00:19:51.638
Where are you-.


00:20:15.039 --> 00:20:16.279
Out of the way!


00:21:05.079 --> 00:21:06.999
This is the Police!


00:21:07.239 --> 00:21:10.719
In the name of the Moon Restoration
Nobody move!


00:21:27.239 --> 00:21:30.039
Captain! You'll have to go around!


00:21:31.239 --> 00:21:33.359
It's too high!
You'll never make it!


00:21:36.718 --> 00:21:37.718
Idiot!


00:21:54.799 --> 00:21:55.799
Go!


00:22:05.479 --> 00:22:06.119
He's down there.


00:22:06.439 --> 00:22:07.439
Yes, sir!


00:22:07.839 --> 00:22:09.159
I said...


00:22:13.799 --> 00:22:16.119
It's tweedle dee and tweedle dum.


00:22:16.639 --> 00:22:18.639
Ugh! Very clumsy!


00:22:19.599 --> 00:22:20.279
Vince!


00:22:20.359 --> 00:22:21.639
Wait for a run!


00:22:24.519 --> 00:22:25.199
Get him!


00:22:25.279 --> 00:22:27.039
I got him!


00:22:29.079 --> 00:22:31.118
But ended up... getting hard knocks!


00:22:33.158 --> 00:22:34.158
Ahhh!


00:22:34.318 --> 00:22:36.638
I'll show you tweeddle...


00:22:43.719 --> 00:22:44.719
Lower!


00:22:46.359 --> 00:22:47.359
Jump!


00:22:57.239 --> 00:22:58.039
Come on!


00:22:58.239 --> 00:22:59.839
Stop gawking and follow me!


00:23:11.719 --> 00:23:12.719
Quiet!


00:23:20.959 --> 00:23:21.999
What is it?


00:23:25.599 --> 00:23:26.799
I think we lost them.


00:23:26.879 --> 00:23:28.518
What's next to my ear?


00:23:30.119 --> 00:23:30.799
A lizard.


00:23:30.919 --> 00:23:31.519
AHHHH!


00:23:31.759 --> 00:23:32.759
Quiet!


00:23:37.759 --> 00:23:38.759
Alright! Game's over.


00:23:39.279 --> 00:23:40.947
Come out and keep your pretty
little hands in the air!


00:23:40.959 --> 00:23:42.199
This is your fault!


00:23:44.799 --> 00:23:45.839
Out! Now!


00:23:51.039 --> 00:23:52.679
I'm coming out. Don't shoot.


00:23:58.519 --> 00:24:02.399
Now who's tweedle dee
and tweedle dum, hmm?


00:24:05.279 --> 00:24:06.279
Where's the girl?


00:24:06.559 --> 00:24:07.959
There! She's right behind you!


00:24:08.039 --> 00:24:10.319
What? Captain!
There's no one there...


00:24:10.599 --> 00:24:11.439
Where's the girl?


00:24:11.559 --> 00:24:12.199
She went that way.


00:24:12.399 --> 00:24:13.559
Hey girl! Run!


00:24:15.599 --> 00:24:16.599
Drop the pills!


00:24:17.439 --> 00:24:19.359
And put your hands down!


00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:22.240
Okay! Since you asked...


00:24:23.040 --> 00:24:25.399
Too slow! Tweedle dums! Haha!


00:24:26.239 --> 00:24:27.479
I'm too old for this...


00:24:28.359 --> 00:24:29.359
Ahhhh!


00:25:05.599 --> 00:25:07.559
I need a cocktail...


00:25:21.999 --> 00:25:24.919
Moon restoration attempt number 6329.


00:25:36.159 --> 00:25:40.199
Attention! Unregistered teleportation!


00:25:40.559 --> 00:25:43.559
Unregistered teleportation!


00:25:45.759 --> 00:25:46.919
Ahhhh!


00:25:47.919 --> 00:25:49.519
Ah.. What...


00:25:51.119 --> 00:25:52.559
Come with me. We gotta go.


00:25:53.439 --> 00:25:54.439
Wait! Wait!


00:25:55.159 --> 00:25:56.199
I just died...


00:25:58.199 --> 00:25:59.199
Get in!


00:26:00.519 --> 00:26:02.360
Down there! Go! Go!


00:26:17.359 --> 00:26:18.359
Wrong way!


00:26:23.759 --> 00:26:24.759
Take a seat.


00:26:32.679 --> 00:26:35.079
Woo-Hoo! Haha!


00:26:39.799 --> 00:26:41.959
Back there...
why did you help me?


00:26:43.439 --> 00:26:45.479
Bad stuff always happens to me...


00:26:45.879 --> 00:26:47.559
Don't need to drag
anyone else down too...


00:26:49.919 --> 00:26:50.919
Is that right?


00:26:51.920 --> 00:26:53.840
You could've killed me
with that window stunt.


00:26:58.200 --> 00:26:59.600
So are you going to answer me?


00:26:59.720 --> 00:27:00.720
Why?


00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:02.040
Get off.


00:27:05.800 --> 00:27:07.920
Someone woke up
on the wrong side of bed.


00:27:08.600 --> 00:27:10.840
You know, at least I get out of bed,


00:27:10.960 --> 00:27:12.720
and don't just watch Cosmoball
like a zombie.


00:27:12.800 --> 00:27:14.239
Yeah? Who won today?


00:27:14.519 --> 00:27:15.279
It was a draw.


00:27:15.359 --> 00:27:16.039
You're wrong.


00:27:16.159 --> 00:27:17.599
I saw it myself.


00:27:18.599 --> 00:27:20.399
You're wrong if you think
you're not a zombie.


00:27:26.559 --> 00:27:27.919
I know you watch it too!


00:27:32.599 --> 00:27:34.879
I need to help my dad
not stare at the sky.


00:27:44.160 --> 00:27:45.600
Why are you staring at me?


00:27:46.240 --> 00:27:48.920
I've never met anyone else
who doesn't like Cosmoball...


00:27:50.560 --> 00:27:51.560
Anya!


00:27:51.640 --> 00:27:52.880
Is your dad sick or something?


00:27:53.560 --> 00:27:54.760
Been helping as long as I can.


00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:56.240
We have a lot in common.


00:27:56.400 --> 00:27:57.440
One thing ain't much.


00:27:57.520 --> 00:27:59.800
No, I mean my mother is sick too.


00:27:59.960 --> 00:28:01.400
I'm going to ask you a question...


00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.720
And don't tell me to get lost.


00:28:05.160 --> 00:28:06.400
What is your name?


00:28:09.080 --> 00:28:10.359
I'd like to see you again.


00:28:10.559 --> 00:28:11.119
You going somewhere?


00:28:11.239 --> 00:28:13.199
I need to go back
to check on my mom.


00:28:14.759 --> 00:28:16.279
You're squishing my hand.


00:28:16.439 --> 00:28:17.439
Oh, sorry!


00:28:21.079 --> 00:28:22.119
Not gonna get lost, right?


00:28:22.999 --> 00:28:23.999
No!


00:28:25.959 --> 00:28:26.959
Anton.


00:28:31.599 --> 00:28:33.320
Hmm... His flask.


00:28:44.360 --> 00:28:45.360
Speak.


00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:48.360
Father...


00:28:49.080 --> 00:28:50.600
Finally I did it!


00:28:51.360 --> 00:28:54.320
He teleported!
The protogene has activated!


00:28:55.160 --> 00:28:56.640
This... is a clump of his hair.


00:29:00.040 --> 00:29:01.400
It's perfect!


00:29:42.000 --> 00:29:45.760
Hahaha!


00:29:47.640 --> 00:29:48.840
What?


00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:52.240
It's not enough.


00:29:53.240 --> 00:29:54.960
But that's everything
I was able to get.


00:30:01.320 --> 00:30:04.279
And you didn't kill him?


00:30:05.199 --> 00:30:08.399
I did what I could.
The protogene is activated now!


00:30:15.560 --> 00:30:17.840
What's the matter, my daughter?


00:30:18.480 --> 00:30:19.720
Have you grown weak?


00:30:19.880 --> 00:30:21.120
No, never!


00:30:25.280 --> 00:30:27.760
If Belo gets his hands on him,


00:30:28.440 --> 00:30:30.960
then my days are numbered.


00:30:31.760 --> 00:30:33.080
Yes, I remember...


00:30:34.880 --> 00:30:37.200
Our days are numbered!


00:31:09.800 --> 00:31:11.160
So grown-up...


00:31:13.360 --> 00:31:14.360
Nice to meet you.


00:31:17.120 --> 00:31:19.520
Relax. Relax.
We don't mean any harm.


00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:21.160
Teleported!


00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:25.920
Congratulations.


00:31:26.200 --> 00:31:28.040
Twenty minutes ago
you teleported.


00:31:28.240 --> 00:31:29.400
You can now play Cosmoball!


00:31:29.640 --> 00:31:32.320
No. No. I don't even like Cosmoball.


00:31:32.480 --> 00:31:34.120
I have to take care of my mom.
She's sick.


00:31:34.200 --> 00:31:34.920
Calm...


00:31:35.000 --> 00:31:36.080
I am sorry to hear that.


00:31:36.280 --> 00:31:37.828
On my planet
we have eradicated disease...


00:31:37.840 --> 00:31:39.628
and I wish the Galactic Council
allowed passing


00:31:39.640 --> 00:31:41.680
of this ability
to the less developed civilizations.


00:31:41.840 --> 00:31:43.760
Well, she was healthy
until your ships showed up.


00:31:44.400 --> 00:31:45.720
I hate Cosmoball.


00:31:47.000 --> 00:31:48.000
What am I missing?


00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:49.920
If that is all, you can go.


00:31:53.800 --> 00:31:56.401
No! Go! Leave!
Is that your life philosophy?


00:31:57.080 --> 00:31:58.080
Yeah.


00:31:58.640 --> 00:31:59.720
No, thank you.


00:32:01.640 --> 00:32:03.120
What do you want from me, anyway?


00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:05.480
Honestly?


00:32:05.840 --> 00:32:06.840
I like you.


00:32:11.480 --> 00:32:12.640
Teleported!


00:32:13.360 --> 00:32:15.920
All we have is now.
Might as well be honest.


00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:19.080
You know...


00:32:19.440 --> 00:32:20.720
Girls like you...


00:32:22.880 --> 00:32:24.080
...you're every guy's dream.


00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:25.080
I'd have never thought-.


00:32:25.160 --> 00:32:26.920
Hands up! We've got you now!


00:32:27.040 --> 00:32:29.000
You're under arrested for the robbery...


00:32:29.240 --> 00:32:34.520
of... a...


00:32:45.721 --> 00:32:48.361
Well, you're not gonna help anyone
if you're locked up behind bars.


00:32:48.801 --> 00:32:50.361
Better start liking Cosmoball.


00:32:51.361 --> 00:32:52.841
What? He doesn't like Cosmoball?


00:32:54.200 --> 00:32:55.480
We'll find a cure for your mom.


00:32:56.360 --> 00:32:57.360
Natasha.


00:32:58.120 --> 00:32:59.120
We have to.


00:33:08.400 --> 00:33:09.400
Deal!


00:33:12.440 --> 00:33:13.440
Deal!


00:33:25.200 --> 00:33:27.600
The stadium-ship is actually
a living organism,


00:33:27.680 --> 00:33:28.680
like a flower.


00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:30.400
I designed and engineered it


00:33:30.520 --> 00:33:33.281
to look like your Earth's dandelion
which is actually what we call it.


00:33:33.960 --> 00:33:35.120
Isn't she beautiful?


00:33:40.121 --> 00:33:41.361
Get in!


00:34:01.600 --> 00:34:03.308
The dandelion will scan
for anything dangerous


00:34:03.320 --> 00:34:05.400
and eliminate it
before it enters its core.


00:34:09.160 --> 00:34:11.520
Foreign contaminant detected.


00:34:15.400 --> 00:34:17.680
Foreign containment destroyed.


00:34:18.600 --> 00:34:21.440
But... It was just a candy bar...


00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:25.200
I was actually...
looking forward to eating that later...


00:34:25.400 --> 00:34:28.161
It must have detected
some dangerous ingredients.


00:34:28.281 --> 00:34:29.281
Better you didn't eat it.


00:35:05.920 --> 00:35:08.600
We are now going to be taking
a sample of your genetic material


00:35:08.680 --> 00:35:10.600
to fuse it with our microchips


00:35:11.120 --> 00:35:14.320
and create a bio mechanical equivalent
of your neural connections.


00:35:14.400 --> 00:35:17.801
The result would be a droid
that we call Sputniks.


00:35:17.881 --> 00:35:20.161
Don't worry, we all have one.


00:35:25.401 --> 00:35:27.641
Look. He's waking up.


00:35:39.241 --> 00:35:40.241
Lizard...


00:35:45.360 --> 00:35:47.040
Say something
so he can identify you


00:35:47.120 --> 00:35:48.760
and know that you are
one and the same.


00:35:49.240 --> 00:35:50.240
Seriously?


00:35:52.880 --> 00:35:54.280
Tell him peek-a-boo.


00:35:56.120 --> 00:35:57.120
Peek-a-boo...


00:36:01.240 --> 00:36:02.240
Nice.


00:36:04.400 --> 00:36:05.600
What should I say?


00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:07.161
Something like peek-a-coo-coo


00:36:07.521 --> 00:36:08.601
I don't know what...


00:36:08.681 --> 00:36:09.681
There he goes!


00:36:11.801 --> 00:36:13.801
Careful, he's a newborn.
Be gentle with him.


00:36:13.961 --> 00:36:14.721
Be quiet!


00:36:14.881 --> 00:36:16.881
Let him concentrate
or we won't hear his name.


00:36:23.361 --> 00:36:26.481
When he senses your connection,
he'll tell you his name is.


00:36:31.801 --> 00:36:33.241
This is so weird.


00:36:40.880 --> 00:36:42.440
The same blood
that flows through you...


00:36:42.520 --> 00:36:43.760
flows through him.


00:36:43.840 --> 00:36:45.320
Tell him you're one.


00:36:45.400 --> 00:36:46.520
What do you mean?


00:36:46.640 --> 00:36:48.640
Say 'We be of one blood, ye and I.'


00:36:48.760 --> 00:36:49.760
Huh?


00:36:49.800 --> 00:36:50.800
Mowgli said that.


00:36:51.440 --> 00:36:53.000
Who the heck is Mowgli?


00:36:54.720 --> 00:36:56.640
Get it off! No! Ahh!


00:36:57.841 --> 00:36:59.241
You scared him.


00:37:00.441 --> 00:37:01.441
Great, that went well.


00:37:02.761 --> 00:37:04.241
Well, that could have gone worse.


00:37:04.881 --> 00:37:06.561
Right, time to train!


00:37:09.601 --> 00:37:10.601
Activate!


00:37:26.241 --> 00:37:28.761
Stepping in here makes
everyone nervous


00:37:28.841 --> 00:37:29.441
fear not.


00:37:29.561 --> 00:37:33.401
We'll train with a ball that's
only minimally charged.


00:37:42.520 --> 00:37:45.120
So now what? Do I hit it?


00:37:46.280 --> 00:37:47.280
Correct.


00:37:49.121 --> 00:37:50.281
Oh boy...


00:37:51.321 --> 00:37:52.721
OK, another one.


00:37:54.321 --> 00:37:55.321
Of course.


00:38:04.481 --> 00:38:06.161
In order for you to strike the ball


00:38:06.441 --> 00:38:08.201
you need to match its speed


00:38:08.281 --> 00:38:09.121
and to do that,


00:38:09.201 --> 00:38:13.481
you'll have to learn to control
your teleportation skills.


00:38:13.921 --> 00:38:15.921
Which were activated
before a truck hit you.


00:38:16.161 --> 00:38:17.241
That's right


00:38:17.521 --> 00:38:18.521
I almost died.


00:38:22.081 --> 00:38:24.041
So it's fear
that caused your teleportation.


00:38:25.281 --> 00:38:28.721
I must return you to that state.


00:38:30.241 --> 00:38:32.561
OK. You wanna fight?
Is that it?


00:38:36.600 --> 00:38:39.561
Don't stop! That's it! That's it!


00:38:43.401 --> 00:38:46.641
Haha! I got away from that one.
I teleported.


00:38:48.321 --> 00:38:49.441
That hurt.


00:38:50.001 --> 00:38:53.601
You almost teleported.
But it's uncontrolled.


00:38:54.001 --> 00:38:55.829
In time you will learn how
to take charge and command your powers.


00:38:55.841 --> 00:38:57.961
Very well.
That's enough for your first day.


00:38:59.801 --> 00:39:00.801
Show me how?


00:39:00.961 --> 00:39:02.121
I'm afraid I can't do that.


00:39:02.561 --> 00:39:03.629
I don't have the ability to jump.


00:39:03.641 --> 00:39:04.641
Maybe I can help?


00:39:07.241 --> 00:39:08.241
Hug me.


00:39:08.441 --> 00:39:09.921
Uhhh. Why would I do that?


00:39:11.241 --> 00:39:13.281
I just figured that
if I teleported with you


00:39:13.321 --> 00:39:14.829
it would help you figure out
how it might work?


00:39:14.841 --> 00:39:17.721
Is there some kind of a middle ground
between carrot and stick?


00:39:18.081 --> 00:39:19.081
What's that?


00:39:19.161 --> 00:39:21.041
Hey! What's your problem?


00:39:21.681 --> 00:39:22.921
What did you say?


00:39:26.961 --> 00:39:29.162
You're not falling down
because I'm teleporting us


00:39:29.242 --> 00:39:31.041
to the same place at
a high frequency.


00:39:35.361 --> 00:39:37.401
You see - it isn't scary to hug!


00:39:45.601 --> 00:39:48.481
No! No! No!
Give me your hand!


00:39:48.641 --> 00:39:50.361
Teleport now or get splattered!


00:39:50.441 --> 00:39:52.321
No! I can't do it!


00:39:52.441 --> 00:39:54.841
Concentrate, Anton.
You have to try.


00:39:54.921 --> 00:39:58.321
No, I can't! Ahhh!


00:40:04.161 --> 00:40:06.161
Are you crazy?
You could have killed me!


00:40:06.241 --> 00:40:07.761
You can't blame a girl for trying.


00:40:07.841 --> 00:40:09.041
That is enough! No more today.


00:40:10.761 --> 00:40:11.761
Wait.


00:40:12.801 --> 00:40:13.801
Let's do it again.


00:40:14.161 --> 00:40:16.201
Woo-hoo-hoo!
Now it's my turn!


00:40:16.921 --> 00:40:18.641
If heights and fights
didn't freak you out -


00:40:18.681 --> 00:40:20.522
let's give you something
a little more intense!


00:40:37.721 --> 00:40:38.761
Yes! That's right!


00:40:39.001 --> 00:40:41.041
Choose the point in space
and teleport to it!


00:40:46.441 --> 00:40:47.441
Again!


00:40:54.321 --> 00:40:55.721
Don't stop now! Go!


00:40:56.441 --> 00:40:58.401
Look! He has a blue trail!


00:40:59.241 --> 00:41:00.081
It's unusual for Earthlings!


00:41:00.201 --> 00:41:03.081
Controlled teleportation...
on the first day! Ha!


00:41:04.361 --> 00:41:05.481
OK, let's do this!


00:41:06.521 --> 00:41:07.521
Now hit the ball!


00:41:07.561 --> 00:41:09.001
And kick it away from you
if you can.


00:41:09.601 --> 00:41:11.270
The power of teleportation
is the same for every athlete


00:41:11.282 --> 00:41:12.442
no matter the size.


00:41:16.082 --> 00:41:17.082
Here we go.


00:41:43.841 --> 00:41:45.001
What just happened?


00:41:46.641 --> 00:41:47.721
Must be a glitch!


00:41:48.521 --> 00:41:49.721
I saw it too.


00:41:52.321 --> 00:41:53.321
Let's watch it again.


00:41:58.121 --> 00:41:59.121
He's using his hands!


00:41:59.601 --> 00:42:00.602
Like a goalkeeper.


00:42:00.682 --> 00:42:02.082
But we don't have a goalkeeper.


00:42:02.322 --> 00:42:03.322
Exactly!


00:42:04.842 --> 00:42:07.842
Five kicks in a row...
None of us can do that.


00:42:08.122 --> 00:42:09.202
I want to try it.


00:42:09.322 --> 00:42:10.722
Don't even think about it.


00:42:12.282 --> 00:42:13.682
We need to study this.


00:42:15.562 --> 00:42:17.082
Belo. At your request,


00:42:17.162 --> 00:42:19.361
the Galactic Council is on the line.


00:42:26.401 --> 00:42:27.401
You play tomorrow.


00:42:27.601 --> 00:42:29.161
- Seriously?
- The first two games, yes.


00:42:29.361 --> 00:42:30.429
Then we'll resume his training.


00:42:30.441 --> 00:42:32.801
Fan, Pele, you're with Anton.
Natasha, come with me.


00:42:35.881 --> 00:42:37.281
You're teaching me later.


00:42:37.761 --> 00:42:39.001
Let's go, keeper-man.


00:42:39.121 --> 00:42:41.721
We still have a problem.
We can't save his mother.


00:42:48.281 --> 00:42:49.921
Then she will die.


00:42:50.161 --> 00:42:53.282
Passing knowledge
to undeveloped nations is dangerous.


00:42:53.922 --> 00:42:54.922
And against the law.


00:42:55.042 --> 00:42:57.322
Then damn the foolish laws!


00:42:57.922 --> 00:43:00.962
Because if we don't help this man,
then we will lose the most gifted athlete


00:43:01.042 --> 00:43:02.602
I've ever encountered.


00:43:03.762 --> 00:43:05.042
His power is unbelievable.


00:43:05.162 --> 00:43:06.522
Beyond anything I have seen.


00:43:06.922 --> 00:43:09.562
His ability to teleport exceeds
that of every other Athlete


00:43:09.642 --> 00:43:12.242
and he has yet
to untap its full potential.


00:43:12.682 --> 00:43:13.322
This is...


00:43:13.562 --> 00:43:16.721
perhaps the next grand step
in humankind's evolution.


00:43:16.841 --> 00:43:20.321
It is our duty
to help and heal his mother.


00:43:20.521 --> 00:43:22.121
It is the right thing to do.


00:43:22.401 --> 00:43:25.361
With all due respect -


00:43:25.441 --> 00:43:28.041
So, I'm going to help her
whatever you decide.


00:43:45.682 --> 00:43:47.002
Can I teleport to the moon?


00:43:48.082 --> 00:43:49.282
I told you that I liked you.


00:43:49.522 --> 00:43:51.602
I've never been that honest
with anyone before.


00:43:52.082 --> 00:43:53.802
Don't you understand what that means?


00:43:55.002 --> 00:43:56.722
- You are honest.
- Of course I am!


00:43:57.402 --> 00:43:59.670
What more do I have to say
so that my feelings can get through


00:43:59.682 --> 00:44:01.802
that thick skull of yours
and you'll understand?


00:44:05.602 --> 00:44:06.602
So can I?


00:44:07.162 --> 00:44:10.202
Idiot. It would take too much energy.


00:44:10.322 --> 00:44:12.082
You'd either be stranded in space,


00:44:12.201 --> 00:44:13.869
or your atoms would kind of all just go...


00:44:13.881 --> 00:44:16.681
...Poof. And scatter everywhere out there.


00:44:18.961 --> 00:44:20.721
Probably shouldn't try then...


00:44:50.722 --> 00:44:52.162
You're all so different.


00:44:52.802 --> 00:44:54.122
And I don't mean young people.


00:44:55.122 --> 00:44:56.642
I'm talking about you, the Athletes.


00:44:57.282 --> 00:44:59.442
I was amazed to see
how easy it was for you


00:44:59.642 --> 00:45:02.602
to say to my son "Anton,
I like you".


00:45:03.082 --> 00:45:04.242
Try not to move too much.


00:45:04.322 --> 00:45:04.882
Sorry.


00:45:05.122 --> 00:45:06.122
Mom?


00:45:07.002 --> 00:45:08.002
Feeling better?


00:45:08.202 --> 00:45:08.801
Yeah...


00:45:09.001 --> 00:45:11.201
I feel I'm getting stronger.


00:45:11.721 --> 00:45:13.241
The biggest changes will come soon.


00:45:13.881 --> 00:45:15.441
Thank you. See!


00:45:16.521 --> 00:45:18.961
We've been waiting 20 years
for her to get better.


00:45:19.721 --> 00:45:20.721
Anton...


00:45:21.201 --> 00:45:22.482
Don't be rude to her.


00:45:42.162 --> 00:45:43.362
Don't get mad at him.


00:45:44.042 --> 00:45:45.882
I know that all mothers say it...


00:45:47.362 --> 00:45:49.122
But... he really is special.


00:45:51.242 --> 00:45:53.002
I was pregnant when the Moon split.


00:45:54.322 --> 00:45:56.162
I felt something pierce my belly.


00:45:56.922 --> 00:45:59.082
Tiny needle... ding!


00:46:02.442 --> 00:46:05.002
He started kicking inside me,


00:46:05.242 --> 00:46:06.481
and then everything went quiet.


00:46:06.641 --> 00:46:07.841
At first I was scared,


00:46:08.201 --> 00:46:10.361
but then I understood it was a sign.


00:46:22.802 --> 00:46:23.802
You Anton?


00:46:24.162 --> 00:46:24.802
Yeah.


00:46:25.042 --> 00:46:26.122
Anya's looking for you.


00:46:26.922 --> 00:46:29.082
Asked me, to give you this.


00:46:29.802 --> 00:46:31.082
She said for you to find her.


00:46:57.802 --> 00:46:58.842
Anya!


00:47:03.482 --> 00:47:04.642
It's me, Anton!


00:47:09.322 --> 00:47:10.882
Anything alive down here?


00:47:11.442 --> 00:47:12.722
Aside from the mold...


00:47:16.642 --> 00:47:19.762
I wanted to ask you what you're using
to help cure your father.


00:47:25.602 --> 00:47:29.042
You... You aren't wearing pants.


00:47:29.602 --> 00:47:33.162
I mean that's cool
if you don't want to wear any.


00:47:33.282 --> 00:47:35.762
It's your house and all...


00:47:44.802 --> 00:47:45.762
You're an Athlete?


00:47:45.802 --> 00:47:46.922
I'm not going back there!


00:47:47.082 --> 00:47:47.882
Cool!


00:47:47.962 --> 00:47:49.922
They told me they'd help my mother,
but they lied.


00:47:49.962 --> 00:47:50.962
Is that true?


00:47:51.042 --> 00:47:52.402
Belo said so, I heard it myself!


00:47:52.522 --> 00:47:54.083
Is it true the stadium's a plant?


00:47:56.163 --> 00:47:57.163
It is.


00:47:57.563 --> 00:47:58.562
Here.


00:47:59.202 --> 00:48:00.322
My father grew this.


00:48:00.842 --> 00:48:04.122
It's a pod that's filled with sap that
will poison any plant from within...


00:48:04.762 --> 00:48:06.002
Then they'll be no Cosmoball,


00:48:06.082 --> 00:48:07.922
and people will stop staring at the sky.


00:48:09.802 --> 00:48:11.002
Or have you changed your mind?


00:48:11.442 --> 00:48:12.562
No, I haven't.
It's just...


00:48:12.642 --> 00:48:14.322
there's a system that protects the plant -


00:48:14.402 --> 00:48:16.482
You can't bring in anything
that will hurt it.


00:48:17.402 --> 00:48:18.402
Ah, right.


00:48:18.602 --> 00:48:20.322
So you changed your mind after all.


00:48:21.282 --> 00:48:22.282
Wait, give it back!


00:48:22.842 --> 00:48:23.842
Give it to me.


00:48:26.402 --> 00:48:27.402
Stop it!


00:48:30.042 --> 00:48:31.042
Can you just...


00:48:41.442 --> 00:48:42.562
I've waited for this.


00:48:48.323 --> 00:48:49.803
Anton? What are you doing?


00:48:51.363 --> 00:48:54.443
We can't get...
out to the city... alone...


00:48:55.242 --> 00:48:56.402
How'd you find me?


00:48:56.802 --> 00:48:57.882
Your Sputnik did...


00:49:00.002 --> 00:49:01.162
Go away!


00:49:02.082 --> 00:49:03.602
Such a star in my basement!


00:49:03.722 --> 00:49:05.002
We should go, Anton.


00:49:06.802 --> 00:49:07.842
She's right.


00:49:17.602 --> 00:49:19.002
Come back soon.


00:49:22.922 --> 00:49:23.922
Let's go.


00:49:41.083 --> 00:49:42.803
Weird... I've got a strange feeling.


00:49:42.883 --> 00:49:45.843
It's your Sputnik warning you
about a potential threat.


00:49:47.283 --> 00:49:50.643
In the name of the Moon restoration.
Stop where you are!


00:49:50.763 --> 00:49:52.922
Careful, sir or you'll trip and fall!


00:49:53.282 --> 00:49:55.190
The probability of danger
is less than 4 percent,


00:49:55.202 --> 00:49:57.322
which is why the Sputniks
didn't activate battle mode.


00:49:58.562 --> 00:49:59.602
It told you all that?


00:50:00.122 --> 00:50:01.122
Yes.


00:50:01.482 --> 00:50:03.922
Stop right there!
You're under arrest for the robbery


00:50:04.002 --> 00:50:07.602
of a drugstore
and assault on a police officer.


00:50:07.882 --> 00:50:09.362
I'll... Get you...


00:50:16.562 --> 00:50:17.682
Oh shut up!


00:50:19.722 --> 00:50:23.122
What happens... if a Sputnik
never actually says its name?


00:50:24.202 --> 00:50:26.763
It could... could...


00:50:27.883 --> 00:50:29.163
...and cost you your life...


00:50:31.243 --> 00:50:33.843
One day your Sputnik will try
to warn you about a threat


00:50:34.443 --> 00:50:37.083
and... if you haven't
established a connection...


00:50:37.163 --> 00:50:38.963
No foreign objects detected.


00:50:41.643 --> 00:50:43.243
...it will be too late...


00:50:44.763 --> 00:50:45.763
Get some sleep.


00:50:46.043 --> 00:50:48.282
The game is more dangerous
than it may seem.


00:50:55.602 --> 00:50:57.202
Look! The games are starting!


00:52:06.002 --> 00:52:08.591
You may not comprehend the
significance of what's transpiring today.


00:52:08.603 --> 00:52:11.243
For now that you join the ranks
of Athletes who become


00:52:11.323 --> 00:52:13.271
a small but exceedingly
important part of the army...


00:52:13.283 --> 00:52:14.603
Yes! Army!


00:52:14.963 --> 00:52:18.083
One that is tasked to inspire...
not only the Earthlings...


00:52:18.163 --> 00:52:20.283
but the rest of...
and why am I so nervous?


00:52:21.483 --> 00:52:22.963
I should have prepared this speech...


00:52:24.003 --> 00:52:26.283
Look! The point is that from today
the Earth team


00:52:26.363 --> 00:52:29.803
is playing with a complete team
and I congratulate you!


00:52:31.163 --> 00:52:32.643
So saddle up!


00:52:33.803 --> 00:52:34.963
Are we horses?


00:52:35.043 --> 00:52:36.483
Ehem... Yes?


00:52:36.843 --> 00:52:38.643
I didn't teach him that.


00:53:28.603 --> 00:53:31.243
Relax and imagine as if you
and your Sputnik are one.


00:53:53.283 --> 00:53:56.363
Excellent! Now that's settled,
your job is to cover Pele.


00:54:00.283 --> 00:54:01.523
Can I take this off?


00:54:01.603 --> 00:54:02.603
Of course.


00:54:02.843 --> 00:54:04.483
Ask your Sputnik to do it for you.


00:54:04.843 --> 00:54:06.043
Now let's go! Let's go!


00:54:06.203 --> 00:54:09.003
Anton goes first.
The crowd is waiting!


00:54:18.363 --> 00:54:20.071
If you need to pee,
it's the 6th pillar on the left!


00:54:20.083 --> 00:54:21.163
Don't get lost coming back!


00:54:24.043 --> 00:54:25.083
Alright. Glove off.


00:54:28.443 --> 00:54:29.723
Come on. Get off.


00:54:33.923 --> 00:54:35.762
Don't do this to me. Come on!


00:54:37.963 --> 00:54:39.003
What do you want me to do?


00:54:39.043 --> 00:54:40.043
Pretend to care again?


00:54:40.443 --> 00:54:41.563
Why does that even matter?


00:54:43.243 --> 00:54:44.243
To care...


00:54:45.523 --> 00:54:47.203
Why should I care?
I grew up alone.


00:54:47.523 --> 00:54:49.163
No one's ever
looked out for me but me.


00:54:49.843 --> 00:54:50.843
I grew up on the streets.


00:54:53.443 --> 00:54:54.603
It's just been me and my mom.


00:54:59.803 --> 00:55:01.603
And you don't even have a mom...


00:55:29.084 --> 00:55:31.483
Yeah, they're pretty big!


00:55:39.523 --> 00:55:40.843
Well, look who it is.


00:55:41.123 --> 00:55:42.323
They say he's cool!


00:55:46.883 --> 00:55:49.563
So you have a goalkeeper now?


00:55:59.723 --> 00:56:00.763
Heee... hello...


00:56:01.403 --> 00:56:03.123
You're very umm...


00:56:03.523 --> 00:56:04.283
Large.


00:56:04.483 --> 00:56:07.083
Don't run into my belly button, got it?


00:56:12.323 --> 00:56:13.563
I like you.


00:56:15.483 --> 00:56:21.324
All we have is now.
Might as well be honest. Hahaha.


00:56:22.884 --> 00:56:23.884
Loudmouth!


00:56:24.004 --> 00:56:25.004
It wasn't me!


00:56:25.124 --> 00:56:26.924
I told them! Sorry...


00:56:27.644 --> 00:56:28.723
But they promised...


00:56:28.883 --> 00:56:30.443
Don't worry! We're cool.


00:56:33.203 --> 00:56:34.403
Jokers!


00:56:39.523 --> 00:56:41.003
It's a super-sized event today!


00:56:41.243 --> 00:56:42.511
For the first time in the finals


00:56:42.523 --> 00:56:44.523
and for the first time
it's four of them!


00:56:44.603 --> 00:56:45.883
Earth's team is complete!


00:56:45.963 --> 00:56:49.363
And listen to that!
Can you believe it?


00:56:49.523 --> 00:56:52.043
Four players! That's three plus one!
Two and two!


00:56:52.163 --> 00:56:54.003
That makes Four players
from planet Earth!


00:56:54.123 --> 00:56:56.403
What a day!
What a beautiful gorgeous day!


00:56:56.523 --> 00:56:57.763
We love you! Yes we do!


00:56:57.883 --> 00:56:59.843
We here and everyone,
without exception, envy you!


00:57:00.003 --> 00:57:03.243
Earthlings, Sirusians, Amazonians...


00:57:03.443 --> 00:57:05.283
...and all the other planets and galaxies,


00:57:05.403 --> 00:57:07.683
in one voice together,


00:57:07.763 --> 00:57:13.844
would like to welcome the new Athlete
Anton!


00:57:14.884 --> 00:57:18.404
Anton! Anton! Anton!


00:57:22.444 --> 00:57:25.163
Hold on! Is that ...? I think it's...


00:57:29.003 --> 00:57:30.763
They're showing Anton!


00:57:32.923 --> 00:57:33.923
Bless you!


00:57:34.443 --> 00:57:35.723
Thank you. Sorry...


00:57:42.043 --> 00:57:43.871
How about we grab dinner
after the game, Chickie?


00:57:43.883 --> 00:57:45.563
Uhh... Okay. Unless I'm dinner...


00:57:57.323 --> 00:57:58.323
Ready?


00:58:39.243 --> 00:58:40.683
Anton, what's wrong?


00:58:48.243 --> 00:58:49.243
Salvo!


00:58:54.964 --> 00:58:56.804
What's little chickie doing
sitting down there?


00:58:59.004 --> 00:59:00.324
What's going on?
What's he doing?


00:59:01.004 --> 00:59:03.444
Get up... Get up... Get up...


00:59:03.844 --> 00:59:05.084
Anton, are you OK?


00:59:07.524 --> 00:59:09.284
His vital signs all seem normal.


00:59:11.724 --> 00:59:12.924
Get up already!


00:59:16.044 --> 00:59:19.123
What are you doing? Stop sitting!


00:59:19.723 --> 00:59:21.083
Booo!


00:59:21.603 --> 00:59:29.563
He's a quitter! He's a quitter!


00:59:34.203 --> 00:59:35.203
What the hell!


00:59:37.883 --> 00:59:39.443
What is this fool doing?


00:59:39.643 --> 00:59:42.432
Let's not jump to conclusions quite so fast
getting call the boy a quitter


00:59:42.444 --> 00:59:45.964
after all, this is
his first game of Cosmoball.


00:59:46.044 --> 00:59:48.124
It might just be a technical malfunction.


00:59:51.524 --> 00:59:53.524
Get up. I'd like you
to come with me please.


00:59:54.004 --> 00:59:55.164
I'm not going anywhere!


00:59:57.444 --> 00:59:58.484
You lied to me.


00:59:58.884 --> 01:00:02.804
You said you were going to help my mom
and that all was just a lie.


01:00:04.004 --> 01:00:05.324
See for yourself, Anton.


01:00:05.884 --> 01:00:09.284
Belo got official permission from the
Council to use extraterrestrial medicine.


01:00:09.404 --> 01:00:10.724
She is already better.


01:00:11.324 --> 01:00:13.204
When was the last time you saw her
so energized?


01:00:13.244 --> 01:00:14.843
Who is... she talking to?


01:00:16.083 --> 01:00:17.083
Come with me.


01:00:29.963 --> 01:00:33.004
I never believed that I would play
a rookie on his first day.


01:00:33.124 --> 01:00:34.484
Much less show him this.


01:00:48.724 --> 01:00:50.004
What you've been practicing with


01:00:50.084 --> 01:00:53.724
is a holographic ball
I created to train Athletes...


01:00:54.844 --> 01:00:56.444
So they'd be ready...
for the real thing.


01:01:04.564 --> 01:01:06.964
This weapon is called a Wave Eater.


01:01:07.804 --> 01:01:10.124
It was forged to consume energy.


01:01:13.763 --> 01:01:15.123
It cannot be destroyed.


01:01:15.603 --> 01:01:18.283
Only discharged
with the five strikes of an Athlete.


01:01:18.843 --> 01:01:21.363
Millions were killed
before we discovered this method.


01:01:21.523 --> 01:01:22.524
Killed?


01:01:22.604 --> 01:01:24.524
Yes, Anton! It was war.


01:01:24.684 --> 01:01:26.604
This stadium is not just a gaming center,


01:01:26.764 --> 01:01:28.404
it also discharges Wave Eaters.


01:01:28.644 --> 01:01:31.364
For years now we've been trying
to save Earth from total destruction.


01:01:32.484 --> 01:01:34.004
Why are they attacking us?


01:01:34.164 --> 01:01:35.324
The Wave Eaters are a weapon.


01:01:35.364 --> 01:01:38.124
Controlled and commanded
by their creator - Cherno.


01:01:42.084 --> 01:01:44.564
He is imprisoned right here,
deep underground...


01:01:45.364 --> 01:01:46.484
...Right under this stadium.


01:01:46.924 --> 01:01:47.964
He's scientist... Like me.


01:01:48.684 --> 01:01:50.764
But he used this power
for his own personal gain...


01:01:50.964 --> 01:01:53.324
...and turned his own experiments
into weapons that


01:01:53.404 --> 01:01:56.444
threaten any life that was not
his own creation.


01:01:56.844 --> 01:01:58.364
Harnessing the power of the stars,


01:01:58.724 --> 01:02:00.164
he would turn the entire universe...


01:02:02.044 --> 01:02:03.924
into a playground, for his experiments.


01:02:04.524 --> 01:02:07.004
His last invention was the Protogene.


01:02:08.043 --> 01:02:10.163
A combination of fused gene cells


01:02:10.603 --> 01:02:12.644
including the power of teleportation,


01:02:12.924 --> 01:02:15.124
which could turn his weapon
into something unstoppable.


01:02:15.684 --> 01:02:16.684
So, we declared war.


01:02:17.604 --> 01:02:20.284
The final battle occurred
near your planet Earth.


01:02:21.244 --> 01:02:22.832
All the hardships Earth faced
in the past 20 years


01:02:22.844 --> 01:02:24.564
are a result of the war with Cherno.


01:02:24.724 --> 01:02:27.564
We won, but Cherno's lab
crashed through the ground


01:02:27.644 --> 01:02:28.992
and was trapped deep inside the Earth,


01:02:29.004 --> 01:02:30.484
where we've kept him imprisoned.


01:02:32.004 --> 01:02:33.752
Because Cherno hasn't escaped,
we assume his protogene


01:02:33.764 --> 01:02:35.604
was somehow
lost during the crash.


01:02:38.324 --> 01:02:40.164
You're saying that,
those balls out there


01:02:40.324 --> 01:02:43.004
are sometimes actually Wave Eaters
that could kill people?


01:02:43.684 --> 01:02:45.284
Why make a game out of it?


01:02:46.244 --> 01:02:49.444
It is easier to risk your life when you
know you are supported by millions


01:02:50.284 --> 01:02:52.764
even if they don't know the truth
or understand the risk.


01:02:53.564 --> 01:02:54.844
And as for the three…


01:02:55.964 --> 01:02:59.644
No... the four proud Athletes...


01:02:59.884 --> 01:03:03.085
You show... everyone who watches you...


01:03:03.565 --> 01:03:05.564
that there is something
to be inspired by...


01:03:06.284 --> 01:03:07.924
...you give them something to hope for...


01:03:11.044 --> 01:03:12.284
Why can't we kill him?


01:03:12.964 --> 01:03:15.444
Drop some kind of gas into his prison
and destroy him that way.


01:03:15.564 --> 01:03:17.284
If we do that, then
his lab would explode


01:03:17.364 --> 01:03:19.164
and the planet would burst
just like the moon.


01:03:19.684 --> 01:03:20.804
This fact protects him.


01:03:21.524 --> 01:03:22.244
And the fans?


01:03:22.364 --> 01:03:22.964
They're safe.


01:03:23.044 --> 01:03:25.404
The dandelion protects them
with a force field.


01:03:27.724 --> 01:03:29.724
So if the dandelion ship was not there,


01:03:29.844 --> 01:03:30.844
then the crowd...


01:03:33.244 --> 01:03:36.364
This would happen to your entire planet
until it was a scorched wasteland.


01:03:38.764 --> 01:03:40.484
Wave Eater releasing in 1 minute.


01:03:41.084 --> 01:03:42.084
- OK.
- Wait.


01:03:42.684 --> 01:03:43.884
Let me get this straight.


01:03:44.604 --> 01:03:47.564
We're about to go play football
with what's essentially a nuclear bomb.


01:03:48.284 --> 01:03:51.804
Created by an angry alien who can't be
killed and wants to take over the universe...


01:03:52.244 --> 01:03:55.205
and everyone else...
Thinks this is just a game...


01:03:55.565 --> 01:03:56.565
Is that right?


01:03:58.445 --> 01:03:59.805
Pretty much it, yes.


01:04:01.164 --> 01:04:02.364
I think I have to go.


01:04:03.004 --> 01:04:03.484
What?


01:04:03.724 --> 01:04:04.724
I'll be right back.


01:04:16.724 --> 01:04:19.244
Come on! Come on! Come on!
Faster! Faster!


01:04:21.364 --> 01:04:22.364
Thank you!


01:04:42.124 --> 01:04:43.124
Glove off.


01:05:07.084 --> 01:05:10.204
Sputnik, connect me to the network.
Quick!


01:05:11.684 --> 01:05:14.484
OK, fifteen seconds everyone.


01:05:24.924 --> 01:05:26.644
Connect me to the network.
Come one!


01:05:28.684 --> 01:05:30.564
Everyone! The Stadium is infected!


01:05:37.965 --> 01:05:39.125
It's not safe here!


01:05:40.205 --> 01:05:41.205
Belo.


01:05:41.405 --> 01:05:42.845
Belo!


01:05:43.765 --> 01:05:45.844
The stadium's been infected!


01:06:18.123 --> 01:06:19.764
Emergency evacuation!


01:06:21.924 --> 01:06:23.964
Emergency evacuation!


01:06:31.405 --> 01:06:32.644
Let's get out!


01:06:34.045 --> 01:06:35.764
Emergency evacuation!


01:06:43.725 --> 01:06:46.924
We're stuck!
It won't let us go!


01:06:50.085 --> 01:06:51.084
It's closing!


01:07:12.404 --> 01:07:13.404
One!


01:07:14.684 --> 01:07:15.685
Natasha.


01:07:36.125 --> 01:07:37.125
Two!


01:07:37.165 --> 01:07:37.845
Three!


01:07:38.125 --> 01:07:38.645
Four!


01:07:38.765 --> 01:07:39.765
Too early!


01:07:42.125 --> 01:07:43.125
No!


01:07:47.724 --> 01:07:48.724
Fifth!


01:07:49.204 --> 01:07:50.204
Five!


01:08:06.165 --> 01:08:07.285
Anton. Are you OK?


01:08:11.285 --> 01:08:12.285
We are fine!


01:08:12.765 --> 01:08:13.765
You did great!


01:08:21.685 --> 01:08:24.285
Thought you were hit...
by the Wave Eater.


01:08:25.045 --> 01:08:26.925
It's a miracle.
Take him to a doctor.


01:08:29.245 --> 01:08:30.245
Hey, chickie.


01:08:32.005 --> 01:08:32.885
You're the man.


01:08:32.965 --> 01:08:34.245
You too - I mean...


01:08:34.405 --> 01:08:35.405
Hey Anton!


01:08:35.845 --> 01:08:36.925
Sweet moves!


01:08:39.685 --> 01:08:40.685
Congratulations!


01:08:47.204 --> 01:08:48.204
Oh..


01:08:48.484 --> 01:08:49.484
What?


01:08:50.284 --> 01:08:51.284
Nothing.


01:09:08.565 --> 01:09:09.565
Glove off.


01:09:22.605 --> 01:09:24.005
Sorry buddy!


01:09:24.325 --> 01:09:27.405
Gotta do this... on my own.


01:09:41.124 --> 01:09:42.124
Anya...


01:09:46.765 --> 01:09:48.525
Don't struggle. It's useless.


01:09:48.645 --> 01:09:50.365
You won't be able to talk or move.


01:10:43.365 --> 01:10:46.845
A virus that imitates the genetic structure
of a dandelion.


01:10:46.925 --> 01:10:48.965
So that's why the immune system
didn't recognize it.


01:10:49.125 --> 01:10:51.645
But how did Cherno
get it into the stadium?


01:10:54.765 --> 01:10:55.765
Anton!


01:10:57.685 --> 01:10:58.725
Battle alarm!


01:11:12.645 --> 01:11:15.005
There isn't a single
being in the universe...


01:11:15.085 --> 01:11:17.125
who knows you better than I do.


01:11:17.885 --> 01:11:20.525
It's me who brought all of your
troubles upon you.


01:11:21.005 --> 01:11:23.805
Falling objects.
The ground splitting beneath your feet.


01:11:24.165 --> 01:11:26.033
I was the one who placed
a box of lizards by your bed


01:11:26.045 --> 01:11:27.646
and ever since you've feared them.


01:11:30.966 --> 01:11:33.245
Your pure and frightened eyes


01:11:34.285 --> 01:11:36.485
watch me in my dreams almost
every night.


01:11:43.205 --> 01:11:44.405
My name is Valaya.


01:11:46.245 --> 01:11:49.685
I had always feared that you wouldn't like
the real me when you saw me.


01:11:53.925 --> 01:11:54.965
You like what you see?


01:11:58.605 --> 01:12:02.005
It's because of you I went against
my father for the first time.


01:12:04.685 --> 01:12:07.445
If only you had destroyed
that stadium...


01:12:10.125 --> 01:12:13.445
...in the perfect world my father
will create...


01:12:15.005 --> 01:12:16.045
...we could have been...


01:12:17.205 --> 01:12:18.246
together...


01:12:19.486 --> 01:12:20.486
forever.


01:12:24.966 --> 01:12:25.966
But instead...


01:12:28.246 --> 01:12:29.486
You failed me.


01:13:10.686 --> 01:13:12.286
Finally!


01:14:51.846 --> 01:14:53.166
Knock-knock!


01:15:23.045 --> 01:15:29.525
Say hello to... your master!
Hahaha!


01:15:36.165 --> 01:15:38.445
This is... part of Cherno's lab.


01:15:43.446 --> 01:15:44.606
Anton, are you OK?


01:15:47.606 --> 01:15:48.606
My boy...


01:15:50.566 --> 01:15:51.366
Tell me...


01:15:51.486 --> 01:15:52.966
you didn't poison the stadium...


01:15:58.566 --> 01:15:59.606
I was me.


01:16:07.526 --> 01:16:08.926
Belo!


01:16:13.366 --> 01:16:14.366
Belo!


01:16:15.086 --> 01:16:16.565
My creator.


01:16:16.765 --> 01:16:19.645
I'll give you a chance to save yourself.


01:16:20.125 --> 01:16:21.405
Come. Join me.


01:16:30.205 --> 01:16:32.126
He said that you were his creator.


01:16:36.126 --> 01:16:37.606
He must have somehow teleported!


01:16:37.886 --> 01:16:38.886
Everyone get ready!


01:16:51.046 --> 01:16:52.126
He saved your life.


01:17:21.166 --> 01:17:23.086
It jumps just like Anton.


01:17:30.846 --> 01:17:32.166
Cherno...


01:17:54.286 --> 01:17:55.286
Father.


01:17:55.486 --> 01:17:57.246
Watch and learn.


01:18:04.126 --> 01:18:05.126
Fly!


01:18:13.206 --> 01:18:14.726
Everybody gather around.


01:18:21.646 --> 01:18:23.526
The Galactic Council
needs to be informed.


01:18:24.646 --> 01:18:25.646
And you...


01:18:27.126 --> 01:18:28.926
You need to spread yourselves
around the city.


01:18:29.206 --> 01:18:30.606
The Wave Eaters will be here soon.


01:18:34.446 --> 01:18:35.446
That's all.


01:19:16.246 --> 01:19:17.246
People of Earth.


01:19:18.566 --> 01:19:19.846
This is Belo.


01:19:20.966 --> 01:19:23.846
It's time...
you learn the truth about Cosmoball.


01:19:24.366 --> 01:19:26.766
It is not a game
But... a war.


01:19:27.486 --> 01:19:29.686
A war that you didn't ask for...


01:19:30.846 --> 01:19:32.206
but one that has found you anyway.


01:19:32.326 --> 01:19:34.286
I built my stadium ship
for one purpose..


01:19:35.726 --> 01:19:38.926
...to prevent the
destruction of your planet.


01:19:39.646 --> 01:19:43.326
Quitter! Quitter! Quitter! Lalala!


01:19:43.686 --> 01:19:45.686
An evil being escaped
from captivity today,


01:19:45.926 --> 01:19:49.086
that can destroy the entire universe.


01:19:50.646 --> 01:19:53.967
All these years I have tried
to protect you from him...


01:19:54.527 --> 01:19:57.487
But I have failed.
Please forgive me.


01:19:59.127 --> 01:20:00.487
Today, like 20 years ago,


01:20:00.607 --> 01:20:02.207
the skies will rain fire,


01:20:02.686 --> 01:20:04.366
and destruction will come to Earth.


01:20:05.486 --> 01:20:06.846
But I have not given up hope.


01:20:06.926 --> 01:20:09.446
I will do all I can to save this planet
and its people.


01:20:10.966 --> 01:20:13.874
Even though a regular human has no defense
against the power of a Wave Eater.


01:20:13.886 --> 01:20:15.846
The Athletes are here to protect you.


01:20:16.646 --> 01:20:18.726
And they need your help too.


01:20:20.646 --> 01:20:23.526
Together we will fight back
this menace.


01:20:24.206 --> 01:20:28.006
Because life is worth fighting for...


01:20:29.286 --> 01:20:31.326
fighting for those you love.


01:20:40.086 --> 01:20:41.166
Tell me if it hurts.


01:20:45.927 --> 01:20:48.727
You don't have to say anything...
I deserve that.


01:21:00.086 --> 01:21:01.086
Anton!


01:21:02.046 --> 01:21:03.046
They're leaving!


01:21:17.806 --> 01:21:20.486
Mom... I really messed up.


01:21:21.686 --> 01:21:22.686
Why did I...


01:21:24.326 --> 01:21:25.806
Don't worry, Anton.


01:21:26.766 --> 01:21:29.086
I don't know
how it is on other planets...


01:21:29.886 --> 01:21:33.006
But I know that on Earth,
people make mistakes.


01:21:34.487 --> 01:21:36.487
They make them all the time.


01:21:39.207 --> 01:21:42.807
But the strong people are those that
try to fix the mistakes they've made.


01:21:48.367 --> 01:21:50.607
I'm going to make something
for dinner.


01:21:57.806 --> 01:22:02.166
His ship can absorb the energy
of anything we fire at it.


01:22:02.206 --> 01:22:04.766
Our only hope is to set up a trap.


01:22:04.926 --> 01:22:06.406
Tell me why
he called you his creator?


01:22:08.246 --> 01:22:10.006
I thought I told you to stay on Earth.


01:22:12.846 --> 01:22:13.846
I'm with you.


01:22:15.086 --> 01:22:17.006
With me or away from him?


01:22:18.286 --> 01:22:20.086
Doesn't really matter now, does it?


01:22:22.846 --> 01:22:24.127
You didn't answer.


01:22:29.487 --> 01:22:31.807
Why did he say that
you were his creator?


01:22:34.047 --> 01:22:36.047
You taught us to trust each other.


01:22:40.807 --> 01:22:42.327
My greatest failure...


01:22:44.687 --> 01:22:45.807
Forged in my image.


01:22:47.207 --> 01:22:49.567
I thought he would assist me
like your Sputniks do.


01:22:50.807 --> 01:22:52.126
But I made a mistake...


01:22:55.006 --> 01:22:56.446
Gave him feelings.


01:22:56.926 --> 01:22:59.366
I failed helping shape those feelings.


01:22:59.446 --> 01:23:01.406
Failed at being
his creator and father.


01:23:02.046 --> 01:23:06.846
I avoided him and he began
to learn on his own.


01:23:07.726 --> 01:23:11.286
The things that he studied were unsafe.
So, I banished him.


01:23:11.646 --> 01:23:12.766
That is why he escaped.


01:23:14.367 --> 01:23:15.687
And we know what happened...


01:23:16.167 --> 01:23:17.527
I failed to kill him...


01:23:31.287 --> 01:23:32.407
My creations...


01:23:33.407 --> 01:23:37.247
Only the athletes can stop us now.


01:23:37.887 --> 01:23:41.447
Keep them on the Earth
as long as you can!


01:24:09.807 --> 01:24:10.807
Save me your pie.


01:24:15.007 --> 01:24:18.407
Alright girls, We can't let them
reach the city!


01:24:18.527 --> 01:24:20.367
Moscow relies on us.


01:24:25.407 --> 01:24:26.447
Boo at two o'clock.


01:24:29.247 --> 01:24:31.607
Stan at five!
Everything gonna be fine!


01:24:31.687 --> 01:24:32.967
- Fan at three
- Yu at twelve.


01:24:33.047 --> 01:24:34.767
- Vo at nine o'clock.
- Pele at six.


01:24:35.607 --> 01:24:36.647
Keep the circle!


01:24:38.407 --> 01:24:42.047
Earthlings, the most dangerous
is two wave eaters...


01:24:42.127 --> 01:24:44.367
coming at you in a line.


01:24:44.647 --> 01:24:45.446
Be careful!


01:24:45.606 --> 01:24:46.806
It's OK! We'll get through!


01:24:50.326 --> 01:24:51.326
Salvo!


01:24:51.806 --> 01:24:52.806
Salvo!


01:24:54.726 --> 01:24:55.247
Salvo!


01:24:55.327 --> 01:24:55.967
Salvo!


01:24:56.287 --> 01:24:57.595
Fan, get ready!
It's coming to you!


01:24:57.607 --> 01:24:58.715
Got away to position twelve.


01:24:58.727 --> 01:24:59.727
Working on it!


01:24:59.807 --> 01:25:00.487
Salvo!


01:25:00.567 --> 01:25:01.247
Fan, hold on!


01:25:01.367 --> 01:25:02.367
Get ready, Vo!


01:25:02.847 --> 01:25:03.847
Oh gosh!


01:25:04.247 --> 01:25:05.247
Salvo!


01:25:07.807 --> 01:25:09.087
Don't overwhelm Fan!


01:25:10.007 --> 01:25:11.007
I'm on it!


01:25:34.607 --> 01:25:39.887
Hmmm... The pathetic ships
of the galactic fleet...


01:25:40.087 --> 01:25:42.006
Hahaha!


01:25:43.646 --> 01:25:47.207
20 years and still no progress!


01:25:47.807 --> 01:25:49.567
Charge primed, commander.


01:25:50.407 --> 01:25:51.407
Then begin!


01:26:08.767 --> 01:26:09.967
What the...


01:26:45.287 --> 01:26:46.567
It's just us now.


01:26:56.327 --> 01:26:59.087
Don't overheat! Don't overheat!
Don't overheat!


01:26:59.247 --> 01:27:00.327
Salvo!


01:27:01.007 --> 01:27:01.687
Salvo!


01:27:01.847 --> 01:27:03.407
Mine, mine, mine!


01:27:03.487 --> 01:27:04.487
Salvo!


01:27:04.727 --> 01:27:06.087
Fan, it's yours!


01:27:07.727 --> 01:27:08.727
Missed it!


01:27:09.847 --> 01:27:11.007
Salvo!


01:27:11.207 --> 01:27:13.447
Ahh! Ahh!


01:27:13.767 --> 01:27:15.207
Fan got hit by a wave!


01:27:20.167 --> 01:27:21.367
Fan, hold on!


01:27:22.367 --> 01:27:23.367
How are you feeling?


01:27:24.007 --> 01:27:25.407
Fan, answer me!


01:27:25.727 --> 01:27:26.728
Are you wounded?


01:27:26.968 --> 01:27:28.048
Are you contused?


01:27:28.448 --> 01:27:30.488
Fan, please, tell me something!


01:27:35.567 --> 01:27:36.567
I'm okay.


01:27:38.287 --> 01:27:39.567
Working on position one!


01:27:39.687 --> 01:27:40.687
Mine!


01:27:41.927 --> 01:27:42.927
Salvo!


01:27:56.607 --> 01:27:58.007
Don't leave home without a snack!


01:28:14.927 --> 01:28:16.807
Please wait for me.
I will be back soon.


01:28:17.768 --> 01:28:19.288
I got to fix something...


01:28:19.608 --> 01:28:20.848
Please don't give up.


01:28:27.688 --> 01:28:29.128
'We be of one blood ye and I.'


01:28:33.007 --> 01:28:34.127
That was Mowgli.


01:28:57.887 --> 01:28:59.047
He saved your life.


01:28:59.807 --> 01:29:01.047
It isn't scary to hug.


01:29:02.167 --> 01:29:03.727
I told you that I liked you.


01:29:26.888 --> 01:29:28.327
Mowgli.


01:29:29.247 --> 01:29:30.247
Anton.


01:29:47.687 --> 01:29:48.687
Help me!


01:29:56.487 --> 01:29:58.127
It's not scary to hug!


01:29:58.728 --> 01:30:00.048
Remember that...
for the future.


01:30:13.568 --> 01:30:14.688
What are you doing?


01:30:17.528 --> 01:30:19.328
I'm covering your back, Pele!


01:30:25.247 --> 01:30:26.367
Protect Fan!


01:30:42.727 --> 01:30:44.167
Forget it!


01:30:47.327 --> 01:30:49.248
Forget it. It's war!


01:30:49.888 --> 01:30:51.168
I like you!


01:30:52.928 --> 01:30:54.168
All we have is now.


01:30:55.248 --> 01:30:57.088
You don't have to say anything!


01:30:57.168 --> 01:30:58.168
Wait for me!


01:31:00.528 --> 01:31:01.728
I like you too.


01:31:02.248 --> 01:31:03.328
A lot.


01:31:05.048 --> 01:31:07.288
I want to... protect you.


01:31:08.008 --> 01:31:10.168
Come on. We have to go!


01:31:16.048 --> 01:31:17.368
I'm fine, Anton.


01:31:18.288 --> 01:31:19.448
I can still fight.


01:31:19.768 --> 01:31:21.567
You did a great job.


01:31:23.447 --> 01:31:25.327
I'll take your place now. Rest.


01:31:27.527 --> 01:31:28.927
Are we going to win?


01:31:29.887 --> 01:31:31.567
- Of course.
- I'm glad you're back.


01:31:31.647 --> 01:31:32.647
Me too.


01:31:41.848 --> 01:31:43.928
Hold this... Let's go!


01:31:44.768 --> 01:31:45.768
This way!


01:31:53.248 --> 01:31:54.248
Come on!


01:32:01.448 --> 01:32:02.768
We'll wait here!


01:32:03.608 --> 01:32:04.608
We'll be safe!


01:32:09.128 --> 01:32:12.648
Keep moving! Nobody stop! Let's go!


01:32:13.608 --> 01:32:15.048
Officer please look after her!


01:32:15.688 --> 01:32:17.048
She needs rest and water.


01:32:17.208 --> 01:32:17.927
Got it?


01:32:18.007 --> 01:32:19.487
Can I... Get an autograph?


01:32:19.887 --> 01:32:20.567
Later.


01:32:20.647 --> 01:32:21.807
- Stay strong.
- Anton...


01:32:27.727 --> 01:32:29.808
Natasha! Natasha!


01:32:29.888 --> 01:32:31.248
Two Wave Eaters in a row.


01:32:31.328 --> 01:32:33.128
Watch out, guys. Watch out!


01:32:33.328 --> 01:32:34.328
Two of them...


01:32:34.808 --> 01:32:36.808
Anton! Fan! Watch out!
They're coming your way!


01:32:37.408 --> 01:32:40.288
Wait! Wait!
He can't hear without his helmet!


01:32:40.568 --> 01:32:42.728
Attention everyone!
Two Wave Eaters in a row!


01:32:48.368 --> 01:32:49.368
Salvo!


01:33:02.168 --> 01:33:03.648
Look! A Sputnik!


01:33:04.328 --> 01:33:05.328
Where is it going?


01:33:23.808 --> 01:33:24.808
Mowgli!


01:34:00.208 --> 01:34:01.208
Take this.


01:34:05.608 --> 01:34:07.528
The ship will now
obey your every command.


01:34:07.968 --> 01:34:09.448
If I don't make it back alive,


01:34:10.208 --> 01:34:12.528
go back to Earth and save
everyone you can.


01:34:17.208 --> 01:34:18.568
But you can leave him if you want.


01:34:29.728 --> 01:34:32.048
Guys, Natasha! I am
not a traitor!


01:34:32.408 --> 01:34:34.208
I wanted to say sorry.
I was an idiot!


01:34:34.288 --> 01:34:37.128
Natasha just went after Cherno!
Get back into position!


01:34:39.328 --> 01:34:40.328
Combat mode!


01:34:41.248 --> 01:34:42.248
Mowgli!


01:34:43.648 --> 01:34:45.048
Let's try this again.


01:35:01.689 --> 01:35:04.009
You discharged
a Wave Eater with one hit!


01:35:04.889 --> 01:35:06.089
You okay man?


01:35:07.728 --> 01:35:09.288
I'm not really sure yet.
Watch me!


01:35:19.128 --> 01:35:20.768
How are you doing that?


01:35:22.968 --> 01:35:24.288
I have no idea.


01:35:24.688 --> 01:35:27.248
But I'm gonna kick their butts
for as long as I can!


01:35:36.568 --> 01:35:39.048
You're doing a great job, little chickie.


01:35:44.368 --> 01:35:46.528
You should never teleport
beyond your line of sight.


01:35:48.048 --> 01:35:49.048
Belo?


01:35:53.329 --> 01:35:54.849
If he dies...


01:35:55.169 --> 01:35:56.449
...The whole thing explodes.


01:35:56.889 --> 01:35:58.369
Please, get back in time.


01:35:58.609 --> 01:36:00.169
Earthlings need their captain!


01:36:00.689 --> 01:36:04.049
You still cower from the thing
you've created.


01:36:05.448 --> 01:36:06.968
I didn't force you to do this.


01:36:09.008 --> 01:36:10.728
I've forgotten what you look like.


01:36:16.568 --> 01:36:17.568
Helmet.


01:36:27.128 --> 01:36:30.888
Ahhh... Now there you are.


01:36:34.448 --> 01:36:35.608
You are the only one-


01:36:35.728 --> 01:36:38.568
-who can truly appreciate
the inventions I've created.


01:36:39.208 --> 01:36:43.649
Which will replace all
that exists in this universe.


01:36:44.169 --> 01:36:46.369
But first... you will show me


01:36:46.449 --> 01:36:48.209
what you have done
in all these years.


01:36:49.489 --> 01:36:53.769
Don't tell me you've wasted your time
with hatred of me.


01:36:54.489 --> 01:36:57.209
If saving the universe
from a madman who wants


01:36:57.289 --> 01:36:59.289
to destroy it is a waste of time
in your mind...


01:36:59.769 --> 01:37:00.768
...then yes.


01:37:04.368 --> 01:37:06.568
Twenty years...


01:37:07.488 --> 01:37:09.888
I've waited for this moment.


01:37:11.888 --> 01:37:14.168
Twenty years!


01:37:17.928 --> 01:37:21.488
I had thought we could have a chat...


01:37:22.888 --> 01:37:23.888
longer!


01:37:30.248 --> 01:37:31.248
Get her!


01:37:32.889 --> 01:37:34.609
You have forgotten, Belo!


01:37:34.689 --> 01:37:38.849
You created me much stronger
that yourself!


01:37:38.929 --> 01:37:42.689
That is how you die today!


01:37:53.529 --> 01:37:54.609
She said I couldn't.


01:38:01.368 --> 01:38:02.368
Natasha!


01:38:09.528 --> 01:38:12.968
It wouldn't have worked... you and him...


01:38:45.649 --> 01:38:46.649
No!


01:38:49.289 --> 01:38:50.889
Noooo!


01:38:51.129 --> 01:38:54.728
You could never match my genius!


01:39:26.369 --> 01:39:29.649
Everybody. Make some space.


01:39:29.929 --> 01:39:32.289
Save some water! Breathe rarely!


01:39:32.369 --> 01:39:33.369
Now...


01:39:33.809 --> 01:39:35.289
Children protect us.


01:39:35.449 --> 01:39:37.009
Come on. Let's go.


01:39:37.169 --> 01:39:38.169
Is she alive?


01:39:38.329 --> 01:39:39.369
We have to fight!


01:39:46.689 --> 01:39:47.809
Fight.


01:39:49.329 --> 01:39:50.688
For those we love.


01:40:04.129 --> 01:40:06.289
Grab a weapon! Come with me!


01:40:19.249 --> 01:40:20.249
Come.


01:40:27.209 --> 01:40:30.969
Do you know what I've dreamt
of all these years?


01:40:33.129 --> 01:40:35.769
That I'd finally face you
and say.


01:40:35.889 --> 01:40:36.889
"Father,


01:40:37.889 --> 01:40:39.689
Farewell."


01:41:01.129 --> 01:41:03.649
You think you're capable...
Of killing her?


01:41:05.569 --> 01:41:07.169
My dear child.


01:41:08.609 --> 01:41:10.609
She has never been a perfect creation.


01:41:21.129 --> 01:41:26.649
You can not teleport
until I order to let you go!


01:41:29.249 --> 01:41:33.449
Your powers belong to me!


01:41:34.169 --> 01:41:37.249
And I will take them back from you!


01:41:40.769 --> 01:41:42.169
Now's your chance.


01:41:51.009 --> 01:41:53.209
The ship is made of your cells.
Talk to it!


01:42:43.649 --> 01:42:45.609
Roaring! Biting! Killing!


01:42:45.849 --> 01:42:47.929
Is that your life philosophy?


01:43:09.289 --> 01:43:10.849
We are of the same blood...


01:43:11.169 --> 01:43:12.169
Listen to me!


01:43:22.009 --> 01:43:23.529
You're just a little kid...


01:43:50.409 --> 01:43:51.409
Hey kid.


01:44:02.169 --> 01:44:03.169
Don't cry.


01:44:05.569 --> 01:44:06.689
We need your help.


01:44:09.169 --> 01:44:10.729
Earthling...


01:44:12.409 --> 01:44:13.609
No way...


01:44:22.610 --> 01:44:23.610
What's happening?


01:44:53.409 --> 01:44:54.169
No!


01:44:54.369 --> 01:44:55.369
Don't you dare!


01:44:55.449 --> 01:44:56.449
I am your master!


01:44:56.729 --> 01:44:58.009
I created you!


01:44:58.529 --> 01:45:01.609
No. No! No!


01:45:07.850 --> 01:45:08.850
Hey!


01:45:28.010 --> 01:45:29.010
Hey!


01:45:35.009 --> 01:45:36.009
Helmet...


01:45:38.969 --> 01:45:39.969
Hey!


01:45:41.249 --> 01:45:43.009
Captain, it was an honor
to serve with you!


01:45:43.369 --> 01:45:44.369
We need to go.


01:45:46.609 --> 01:45:48.649
It's time to show them
what we're made of!


01:46:13.170 --> 01:46:14.170
See that?


01:46:14.770 --> 01:46:16.650
It's a fireball, captain.


01:46:17.490 --> 01:46:19.730
It looks like victory!


01:46:20.570 --> 01:46:24.930
And that's how we do it
in the Police!


01:46:44.289 --> 01:46:45.489
The danger has passed.


01:46:46.609 --> 01:46:48.318
And harnessing the energy of the remaining
Wave Eaters will enable us


01:46:48.330 --> 01:46:50.090
